Raw image data are not included in this repository. Public datasets must be obtained
from their original source platforms (The Cancer Imaging Archive and Kaggle).
Restricted institutional data from Hitit University Faculty of Medicine are not
redistributed. Users are responsible for complying with the original licenses, access
terms, ethics approvals, and data-governance requirements of those datasets.
